.DS_Store

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# veri commits four kinds of .tdd/ file: the ledger .tdd/issue-<n>.md (the source of
# truth for which steps are done), .tdd/issue-<n>-added.md, -refactor-owed.md and
# -metrics.md (a run's only committed figures, since the journal
# is ignored). Everything else under .tdd/ is run state and ignored: leaf logs and
# prompts, the blind spec -spec.md, the Draft-PR step's -pr-body.md, any other
# issue-<n>-*.md, and the journal events.jsonl. Last match wins: every issue-*-*.md is
# re-ignored, then the three suffixed kinds are admitted again.
.tdd/*
!.tdd/issue-*.md
.tdd/issue-*-*.md
!.tdd/issue-*-added.md
!.tdd/issue-*-refactor-owed.md
!.tdd/issue-*-metrics.md
*/**/.tdd/
